# CI (joinUp)

- `.github/workflows/ci.yml` must run the Next 15 build (`next_app`) + Prisma migrate + Jest
  (`server`) on Node 20, against a disposable Postgres service, for PRs to `main`/`Dev` and pushes to
  `Dev`.
- Do not scope it to Next-only builds on PRs to `main`, and do not pin Node 18 — both have shipped
  broken before (server tests silently never ran).
